# Build context is the repo ROOT (the deployd shared CI include runs
# `docker build .`). Only web/ is needed by the Dockerfile — exclude everything
# else, then trim the heavy/dev-only parts of web/ for a lean, deterministic build.
*
!web
web/node_modules
web/.next
web/out
web/storage
web/.env
web/.env.*
!web/.env.example
web/npm-debug.log*
web/test
web/vitest.config.ts
web/README.md
web/**/.DS_Store
